      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just exhaustion though. exhaustion implies you can recover if you sleep or rest. but this feels permanent. like the trauma actually changed my core. i feel like a machine that's been run until the parts are just warped and useless. you can't just \"rest\" your way out of being fundamentally defective.",
